---
import Legal from "@/layouts/legal.astro"
import { POLICY } from "@/lib/site"
---

<Legal
  title="Cookie Policy | Abu Reel Kit"
  description="This site doesn't use tracking or advertising cookies, so there's no cookie banner. Here's what happens instead."
  path="/legal/cookies"
  heading="Cookie Policy"
  summary="This site sets no tracking or advertising cookies, which is why you don't see a cookie banner. The one cookie we set is for your download."
  updated={POLICY.cookies}
>
  <h2>Our site</h2>
  <p>We don't use ad pixels or cross-site tracking. Page statistics come from Cloudflare Web Analytics, which is cookieless and doesn't build visitor profiles.</p>
  <p>Cloudflare may set a strictly necessary security cookie if it needs to tell people from bots. These cookies don't need consent because the site can't be protected without them.</p>

  <h2>Your download</h2>
  <p>When you continue to payment we set one strictly necessary cookie, <code>kit_pass</code>. It lets this browser, and no other, download the kit after you pay, so a copied link gives nobody else your purchase. It lasts one day, holds only a random value and isn't used for anything else.</p>

  <h2>Checkout</h2>
  <p>When you continue to payment you move to Dodo Payments' hosted checkout. It may use its own necessary cookies for security and fraud prevention, under its own policy.</p>

  <h2>If this changes</h2>
  <p>If we ever add non-essential cookies, we'll ask for your consent first and update this page.</p>
</Legal>
